        "TileImage": "$($repository ee454990-0c4b-49e5-9572-a67887325283).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rThe outcome of our previous contracts failed to meet our former client’s expectations. Instead of boosting firearm demand, the fallout led to increased global tariffs on bladed instruments.\r\rThis has impacted GAMA, where rising costs of surgical tools have displeased its director, Akira Nakamura. He believes several individuals are responsible for this, and wants them removed.\r\rI’ll leave you to prepare.",
